{"id":"dd50e51ec6d9cf91","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-consistent.md","title":"Consistency (Syntactic)","display":"df-consistent — Consistency (Syntactic)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-consistent","aliases":["57-df-consistent"],"display":"df-consistent — Consistency (Syntactic)","depends_on":["[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]","[[57-df-finite-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistent — Consistency (Syntactic)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"767b690e575dbfa5\" href=\"?note=767b690e575dbfa5\" title=\"57-df-SequentCalculus\">57-df-SequentCalculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f570926126f9a186\" href=\"?note=f570926126f9a186\" title=\"57-df-finite-subset\">57-df-finite-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (句子集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的有限子集类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f570926126f9a186\" href=\"?note=f570926126f9a186\" title=\"57-df-finite-subset\">57-df-finite-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}\\)</span> (sequent calculus, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"767b690e575dbfa5\" href=\"?note=767b690e575dbfa5\" title=\"57-df-SequentCalculus\">57-df-SequentCalculus</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash \\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg \\exists \\Phi_0 \\in [\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega} \\; \\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}} (\\Phi_0 \\Rightarrow \\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash \\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg \\exists \\Phi_0 \\in [\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega} \\; \\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}} (\\Phi_0 \\Rightarrow \\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>一致性的三种等价定义</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>语形一致性 (Syntactic)</strong> — 当前定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg \\exists \\Phi_0 \\in [\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega}\\; \\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}} (\\Phi_0 \\Rightarrow \\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg \\exists \\Phi_0 \\in [\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega}\\; \\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}} (\\Phi_0 \\Rightarrow \\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的有限子集可推出矛盾。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>可证性一致性 (Provability)</strong> — see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" href=\"?note=c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" title=\"57-df-consistency\">57-df-consistency</a></p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg(T \\vdash \\bot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}(T) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg(T \\vdash \\bot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 不能推出矛盾式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>语义一致性 (Semantic)</strong> — see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"befcfc958ddf5dbd\" href=\"?note=befcfc958ddf5dbd\" title=\"57-df-satisfiable\">57-df-satisfiable</a></p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\;(\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\Phi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\;(\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\Phi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即存在模型满足句子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>等价性定理</strong>：见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"537b8a526b8d31ce\" href=\"?note=537b8a526b8d31ce\" title=\"57-thm-satisfiability-consistency\">57-thm-satisfiability-consistency</a></p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi) \\Longleftrightarrow \\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi) \\Longleftrightarrow \\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在经典一阶逻辑中，三种定义等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","an