t}_S","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Phi]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash \\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg \\exists \\Phi_0 \\in [\\Phi]^{<\\omega} \\; \\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}} (\\Phi_0 \\Rightarrow \\emptyset)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg \\exists \\Phi_0 \\in [\\Phi]^{<\\omega}\\; \\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}} (\\Phi_0 \\Rightarrow \\emptyset)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(T) \\Leftrightarrow \\neg(T \\vdash \\bot)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi) \\Leftrightarrow \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\;(\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\Phi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}(\\Phi) \\Longleftrightarrow \\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi)","display":true}],"bytes":1585,"backlinks":[{"id":"c3d5023e5f50e6a0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，见 [[57-df-sentence]]。本文件的无下标 $T\\vdash\\varphi$ 专指 [[57-df-derivable]] 的经典矢列演算单后件读法；不是任意总规则证明系统。$x_0$ 是固定变量，$\\bot$ 为下述无自由变量矛盾公式。有限矢列一致性见 [[57-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9b85d91ff43cdd46","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba2923371a2ce5ea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6bc1af7db6d79fc6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f967e0a65e70f51b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d7c14afe5ff8ba89","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-consistent]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-29","loc